# DS5005: `ymin` must be below `ymax`.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render timechart with (ymin = 10, ymax = 5)
---- expected
error[DS5005]: `ymin` must be less than `ymax`
  --> query:2:33
  |
2 | | render timechart with (ymin = 10, ymax = 5)
  |                                 ^^         - `ymax` is 5
  |                                 |
  |                                 `ymin` is 10
